WEBVTT

46:32.072 --> 46:34.365
Calling Buzz Lightyear.
Come in, Buzz Lightyear.

46:34.908 --> 46:36.576
-This is Star Command.
-Star Command!

46:36.660 --> 46:39.162
-Buzz Lightyear, do you read me?
-Buzz Lightyear responding.

46:39.246 --> 46:40.329
Read you loud and clear.

46:40.414 --> 46:42.915
Buzz Lightyear,
planet Earth needs your help.

46:43.000 --> 46:45.168
-On the way!
-Buzz Lightyear!

46:45.252 --> 46:49.755
The world's greatest superhero!
Now the world's greatest toy!

46:49.840 --> 46:52.800
Buzz has it all!
Locking wrist communicator!

46:52.885 --> 46:55.344
-Calling Buzz Lightyear!
-Karate chop action!

46:55.429 --> 46:57.430
-Wow!
-Pulsating laser light!

46:57.514 --> 47:00.892
-Total annihilation!
-Multi-phrase voice simulator!
